Question: Did Sorrento Therapeutics break the law by not posting results for its terminated COVID-19 trials?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: The Lead hit its lookup cap and planned from what it had found.; Stopped at the cap of 3 research rounds.

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Analyze all terminated or withdrawn COVID-19 trials sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, including NCT04900428 and NCT04903327. Determine their enrollment, primary completion dates, stated reasons for stopping, results due dates, and whether results have been submitted to ClinicalTrials.gov.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 (Study to Evaluate a Single Intranasal Dose of STI-2099 (COVI-DROPS\u2122) in Outpatient Adults With COVID-19 (UK)) was terminated with an enrollment of 179 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 primary completion date was March 22, 2022.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 stated why_stopped reason is \"Study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants\", categorized under efficacy.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 results due date was March 22, 2023, and results have not been submitted/posted on ClinicalTrials.gov.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress) was terminated with an enrollment of 43 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 primary completion date was August 29, 2022.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 stated why_stopped reason is \"Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets\", categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 results due date was August 29, 2023, and results have not been submitted/posted on ClinicalTrials.gov.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via ClinicalTrials.gov."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Search SEC EDGAR for Sorrento Therapeutics filings, such as 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K, near the termination dates of their COVID-19 trials, including NCT04900428 and NCT04903327. Examine how the company described these trials and their outcomes to investors.", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: ctgov:NCT04900428, ctgov:NCT04903327, sql:d441f0f0, sql:f549949d.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428", "ctgov:NCT04903327", "sql:d441f0f0", "sql:f549949d"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Search SEC EDGAR for Sorrento Therapeutics filings, such as 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K, near the termination dates of their COVID-19 trials, including NCT04900428 and NCT04903327. Examine how the company desc"]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Search PubMed and Europe PMC for any literature, including preprints, associated with Sorrento's terminated COVID-19 trials, such as NCT04900428 and NCT04903327. Review their publication status, dates, and conclusions.", "findings": [{"claim": "For trial NCT04900428, find_publications identified one publication (PMID 34473343) via a snapshot PubMed SI link, which is a Cochrane systematic review on SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing monoclonal antibodies mentioning NCT04900428 among many trial identifiers.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "The review does not report trial-specific results or conclusions for NCT04900428."}, {"claim": "For trial NCT04903327, find_publications found no direct PubMed articles; instead, it returned five Europe PMC mention records (PMIDs 34831101, 35321737, 35782071, 35897770, 38005826) that broadly discuss mesenchymal stem cell therapies or multi-organ failure in COVID-19.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "These are only literature mentions of the drug or trial and do not report results or conclusions for NCT04903327."}], "gaps": ["No primary trial results publication was found in PubMed or Europe PMC for NCT04900428 or NCT04903327. Results may exist in conference abstracts or company press releases, which these bibliographic databases do not cover."]}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 2, "brief": "Search SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261 or Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc.) from March 2022 through late 2023. Search for mentions of NCT04900428, NCT04903327, STI-2099, COVI-DROPS, or COVI-MSC in filings such as 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K to determine how the company disclosed the termination of these trials and whether any results or material trial updates were communicated to investors.\n\n(Gap to close: The researcher hit the turn cap before finding SEC disclosures regarding Sorrento Therapeutics' trials NCT04900428 and NCT04903327.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: sql:f549949d.", "evidence_ids": ["sql:f549949d"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Search SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261 or Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc.) from March 2022 through late 2023. Search for mentions of NCT04900428, NCT04903327, STI-2099, COVI-DR"]}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 3, "brief": "Search SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between March 1, 2022 and December 31, 2023. Use highly targeted keyword queries for 'STI-2099', 'COVI-DROPS', 'COVI-MSC', 'NCT04900428', or 'NCT04903327' within 10-K and 10-Q filings to find how the company disclosed these trial terminations to investors. Keep search queries simple to avoid hitting the tool turn cap.\n\n(Gap to close: Sorrento Therapeutics SEC disclosures regarding trials NCT04900428 and NCT04903327 were not retrieved due to previous searches hitting the turn limit.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 (Study to Evaluate a Single Intranasal Dose of STI-2099 (COVI-DROPS) in Outpatient Adults With COVID-19) was terminated because the study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "From ClinicalTrials.gov record in the snapshot."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress) was terminated due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "From ClinicalTrials.gov record in the snapshot."}, {"claim": "The snapshot contains no filings table data or SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics or trials NCT04900428 and NCT04903327, and live SEC searching failed because SEC_USER_AGENT is not set.", "evidence_ids": ["sql:f549949d"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Filings table is empty in the snapshot and live EDGAR search encountered a configuration error."}], "gaps": ["SEC EDGAR filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) could not be retrieved due to a missing SEC_USER_AGENT environment configuration."]}]

